              "to": "Warehouse",\
              "description": "Overrides the document warehouse for this stock line."\
            \},\
            "account_id": \{\
              "type": "text",\
              "note": "LED-50. Which income account this line credits \'97 an account id, an account name or a logical key (engine/accounts.py resolves all three). Blank means the document's default revenue account, which is what every line used to get. Bill.items has carried the same field all along; Invoice.items did not, so freight recovered from customers and coupon discounts given were both buried inside the Sales line and neither could be reported."\
            \},\
