              "description": "What this party IS to the business. A school's parent is a `guardian`, not a `customer`; a clinic's referring GP is a `referrer`, not a `partner`. Three agents building school and clinic data had to file parents and GPs as `customer`/`partner` because nothing else fitted \'97 and terminology renames Party to Student, so a mother appeared under a \\"Student\\" label."\
